      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠺᠥᠴᠥᠷᠺᠡᠺᠥ</unicode>
      <uighur>küčürkekü</uighur>
      <cyrillic>хүчирхэх</cyrillic>
      <transcript>KYCYRKE-</transcript>
      <definition>v.t. and i. To [use] force, compel, show violence; to make a display of or boast of one's strength.</definition>
      <page>496</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠺᠦᠴᠦᠷᠺᠡᠨ</unicode>
          <transcript>--n</transcript>
          <definition>By violence, by force</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠺᠦᠴᠦᠷᠺᠡᠨ ᠠᠪᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>--n abxu</transcript>
          <definition>To seize by force</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠺᠦᠴᠦᠷᠺᠡᠨ ᠺᠦᠯᠢᠶᠡᠯᠭᠡᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>--n kylijelgeky</transcript>
          <definition>To force something upon somebody</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠺᠦᠴᠦᠷᠺᠡᠵᠦ ᠺᠢᠯᠭᠡᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>--zy kilgeky</transcript>
          <definition>To force to do or make</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
